{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spacenap is a small corner of paradise taking place in space and that you can put anywhere on your screen. Hunt stars, buy upgrades and create your own collectable constellations. This is the perfect idler and automated multitask toy to have while you do other things.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/f48779c336cf57f9995aa6919deefef6.avif?t=1755556114\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNT STARS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/7960bf187de187444b2362b6295daed8.poster.avif?t=1755556114\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/7960bf187de187444b2362b6295daed8.webm?t=1755556114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/7960bf187de187444b2362b6295daed8.mp4?t=1755556114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatically or manually scout starfields with scout owls to discover and gather as much stars as possible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find a variety of stellar items that can then be used to create your own constellations or be sold.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your recolter owls and your own clicks to collect them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you focus on super massive stars? Low temperature ones? A mix of those ? Or will you find the super rare UFOs...?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE CONSTELLATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/6382d33e810a6c41ee56d40f2818388b.poster.avif?t=1755556114\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/6382d33e810a6c41ee56d40f2818388b.webm?t=1755556114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/6382d33e810a6c41ee56d40f2818388b.mp4?t=1755556114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your stars to create your own constellations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover all constellations patterns and find exclusive hidden ones!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Giving passive bonuses, you can then decide to let them go and retrive gold coins you can use somewhere else.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUY UPGRADES AND PROGRESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/75fb722e68392fb7dbe2467bf49b2849.poster.avif?t=1755556114\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/75fb722e68392fb7dbe2467bf49b2849.webm?t=1755556114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/75fb722e68392fb7dbe2467bf49b2849.mp4?t=1755556114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover plenty of upgrades that you can buy from your stars and constellations' money.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From automated scout and recolter owls to new events and gameplay options, carve your own path and optimize your progression as you want.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain levels throughout the game and discover new galaxies with their own stellar secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTITASKING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/b53c0c9c178a24d6efbef52afe5ad298.poster.avif?t=1755556114\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/b53c0c9c178a24d6efbef52afe5ad298.webm?t=1755556114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/b53c0c9c178a24d6efbef52afe5ad298.mp4?t=1755556114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spacenap sits on your screen while you work or have fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place it anywhere, at any size, decide if it stays above other windows, enable only important sound alerts...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is YOUR own toy so choose how it behaves.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920420?t=1755556114","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/c74a2eeba1764a49d2cd8cf8877565b4a10d3caf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755556114","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/baf18c26ad519c795515c594d3fbce4746e5e331/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755556114","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/baf18c26ad519c795515c594d3fbce4746e5e331/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755556114","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}