static.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/75fb722e68392fb7dbe2467bf49b2849.mp4?t=1755556114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover plenty of upgrades that you can buy from your stars and constellations' money.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From automated scout and recolter owls to new events and gameplay options, carve your own path and optimize your progression as you want.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain levels throughout the game and discover new galaxies with their own stellar secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTITASKING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/b53c0c9c178a24d6efbef52afe5ad298.poster.avif?t=1755556114\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/b53c0c9c178a24d6efbef52afe5ad298.webm?t=1755556114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/b53c0c9c178a24d6efbef52afe5ad298.mp4?t=1755556114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spacenap sits on your screen while you work or have fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place it anywhere, at any size, decide if it stays above other windows, enable only important sound alerts...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is YOUR own toy so choose how it behaves.</strong></p>","developers":["Eleven Dusks Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/30abdc928d3517cb17f03a1c636908a2b5613dda/header.jpg?t=1755556114","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Spacenap \u00a92025 Eleven Dusks